name: modl-lints
mapping: typed
spec: 14.3
expect: bash
=== modl ===
a red square echo hi                   # "square" after the color is text
b square /usr/bin/wc -l                # URL slot swallows the path
c square echo abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
a -> b
b -> c solid this edge label is far too long
c -> d &&                              # solid edge with control text
=== bash ===
square echo hi | -l | echo abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz | d
=== stderr ===
"square" is out of modl's attribute order
"/usr/bin/wc" filled the URL slot
node "c" label is 31 chars
edge label is 31 chars
solid edge has text "&&"
